🔔 New Leave Request Requires Your Approval
=====
<h2>Hello {{#with approver }}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}},</h2>

<div class="info-box info-box-warning">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #d97706;">⏰ Action Required</h3>
  <p><strong>{{#with requester}}{{this.full_name}}{{/with}}</strong> has submitted a new leave request that requires
    your approval.</p>
</div>

<div class="content-card">
  <div class="content-card-header">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; color: #1f2937;">📅 Leave Request Details</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="content-card-body">
    <p><strong>{{>leave_request_detail leave=leave }}</strong></p>
    {{> email/leave_comments comments=comments }}
  </div>
</div>

{{> email/requester_allowance requester=requester requesterAllowance=requesterAllowance}}

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">⚡ Quick Actions</h3>
  <p>Review and respond to this request:</p>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
    <a href="{{concatenate (get_application_domain) '/requests/' }}" class="btn"
      style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px;">Review
      Pending Requests</a>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">You can approve, reject, or request more information
  </p>
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">📊 Employee Leave Summary</h3>
  <p>This information may help you make your decision:</p>
  <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 0;">
    <li>Current year leave taken and remaining</li>
    <li>Previous leave patterns</li>
    <li>Team coverage considerations</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 20px;">Best regards,<br><strong>The TimeOff.Management Team</strong></p>